{"text": "At one second, something pushes the cart: its speed jumps by 0.3 metres per second, and nothing in the model said that would happen. The grey dashed curve is the plan made at time zero. Executed blindly, step after step, it never learns about the push, and the cart hits the wall at almost two metres per second. The blue controller re-plans every tenth of a second from the measured state. It sees the extra speed at once, starts braking earlier, and docks at seven seconds. Applying only the first step is what turns a plan into feedback.", "lang": "en", "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural", "duration": 34.6, "words": [[0.1, 0.2, "At"], [0.212, 0.463, "one"], [0.463, 0.9, "second"], [1.275, 1.65, "something"], [1.65, 2.038, "pushes"], [2.05, 2.137, "the"], [2.138, 2.5, "cart"], [3.062, 3.15, "its"], [3.15, 3.525, "speed"], [3.525, 3.862, "jumps"], [3.875, 4.037, "by"], [4.037, 5.1, "0.3"], [5.1, 5.462, "metres"], [5.463, 5.613, "per"], [5.625, 6.112, "second"], [6.487, 6.625, "and"], [6.638, 6.975, "nothing"], [6.975, 7.025, "in"], [7.025, 7.075, "the"], [7.075, 7.425, "model"], [7.438, 7.763, "said"], [7.775, 7.888, "that"], [7.888, 7.975, "would"], [7.975, 8.338, "happen"], [8.75, 8.825, "The"], [8.825, 9.05, "grey"], [9.062, 9.412, "dashed"], [9.425, 9.775, "curve"], [10.025, 10.1, "is"], [10.1, 10.175, "the"], [10.175, 10.55, "plan"], [10.562, 10.825, "made"], [10.838, 10.925, "at"], [10.925, 11.238, "time"], [11.238, 11.775, "zero"], [12.175, 12.713, "Executed"], [12.725, 13.375, "blindly"], [13.613, 13.925, "step"], [13.938, 14.213, "after"], [14.225, 14.65, "step"], [15.088, 15.225, "it"], [15.238, 15.575, "never"], [15.575, 15.887, "learns"], [15.887, 16.113, "about"], [16.113, 16.188, "the"], [16.188, 16.762, "push"], [16.938, 17.025, "and"], [17.025, 17.112, "the"], [17.113, 17.512, "cart"], [17.525, 17.762, "hits"], [17.762, 17.863, "the"], [17.875, 18.288, "wall"], [18.3, 18.375, "at"], [18.387, 18.762, "almost"], [18.762, 19.0, "two"], [19.0,